categories":"Restaurants, Seafood","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"kdqoDMuvyNedsouc1i33vQ","name":"Araña Taqueria y Cantina","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_C7QiQQc47AOEv4PE3Kong","name":"Commander's Palace","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"8kh6Z3c8UHQKmsy0_TbOnA","review_id":"gBKaYbgYxClqnNWPBw6KTw","date":"2017-03-26T02:35:22","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.950415313243866,"text_excerpt":"I cannot speak highly enough if Carmo. It's one of those restaurants where you can go and eat a healthy meal but still have something insanely delicious that'll keep you coming back for me. My all time favorite is the Rico, which I get completely vegan. As an avid plantain lover, this is my heaven. Truly. If you told me I was dying tomorrow, this could very well be my choice of last meal. I also LOVE the Esmeralda salad. The dressing is a little spicy, but it's exactly what the salad needs. I think there's some nutritional yeast in it, and it really helps to round out the spicy in the dressing, nutty in the quinoa, and sweet in the corn. You can also tell that the greens are always super ..."},{"business_id":"8kh6Z3c8UHQKmsy0_TbOnA","review_id":"YbNkoiKcA8LB7tNbHCPLXg","date":"2012-06-17T19:24:03","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9442828893661499,"text_excerpt":"YUM! The food here was fresh, healthy, delicious and literally just bursting with flavor. I can't wait to go back and try everything on their small but packed with punch menu. I had the small Esmerelda salad (quinoa, corn, black bean, red bell pepper salad with pumpkin seeds and the most divine coconut chili lime dressing) and the Pao de Quijio chewy cheesy balls (come to think of it, combined with my love of Mimi's goat cheese balls, it appears I have a thing for crispy yet gooey cheese in a spherical formation). Next time I'm getting Acaraje - black eyed peas fritter with cashew peanut paste and shrimp - yes please! Lots of authentic tropical juices - never thought I'd see soursop juice..."},{"business_id":"8kh6Z3c8UHQKmsy0_TbOnA","review_id":"Ivux5HZgYMnZLqD0-D41sQ","date":"2016-07-01T14:28:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9440584182739258,"text_excerpt":"As soon as I arrived in NOLA, anyone who has ever heard I'm vegan told me I \"must try Carmo.\" Finally made it there last night for dinner and am already making plans to go back. we arrived around 8pm and there was no wait, although it was far from empty. The other person in my part is a pescetarian. He got yellow fin sashimi and ate it within mere minutes. We shared one of the avocado plates, with spices, red onion, sprouts and corn. It was absolutely delicious. But my favourite was the Esmeralda salad. I don't normally like vegan cheese, and almost asked them to leave it off, but I'm so happy I didn't. My friend took a bite to try it, and then another, and another, and another... The ser..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"8kh6Z3c8UHQKmsy0_TbOnA","photo_id":"jeTB79gou_RSwIcwNeK6Aw","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/jeTB79gou_RSwIcwNeK6Aw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8840758800506592},{"business_id":"8kh6Z3c8UHQKmsy0_TbOnA","photo_id":"C48G0gSD-Uw_sWaHRPvjpA","label":"outside",